 *   **Formula**: Ellipsoidal density function: $d = a \left( \frac{(X - X_0)^2}{b^2} + \frac{(Y - Y_0)^2}{c^2} + \frac{(Z - Z_0)^2}{c^2} \right)$ (Note: Source text garbled, likely standard ellipsoid equation form). Contours are ellipsoids [S2, book].
 
 ## Background
-The specific application of procedural noise to volumetric rendering was pioneered by Kajiya and Von Herzen for volume rendering [Kaj84], and later refined by Gardner using pseudo-fractal trigonometric series for cloud surfaces [Gard84] [S2, book]. Modern implementations leverage GPU parallelism for on-the-fly evaluation, as seen in Ray-Guided Streaming techniques [S1, unofficial].
